  <string name="copilot_service_label">Offer Copilot</string>
  <string name="copilot_service_description">Reads the fare, distance, time, and rating of offers in ride-hailing apps to show your numbers, and notes when you tap accept or decline, to estimate your earnings. If you turn on the option, it can also read the screen image on Uber and 99, on the device itself and without saving it. It doesn\'t touch the screen, doesn\'t accept or decline rides, and nothing leaves the device.</string>
